********************************************************************************
* Process        : 0.11 um Logic and Mixed-Mode 1P8M Metal Metal Capacitor Al Advanced Enhancement Process
* Device Type    : N- and P-FET
* Description    : 5V MOS Transistor
* Model          : BSIM3.3.24 (HSPICE Level=49)
* Simulator      : HSPICE
* Model Version  : v031
* Model Features :
*     Global model            : Yes
*     Igate model             : NA
*     GIDL model              : NA
*     Substrate current model : Yes
*     Flicker noise           : Yes
*     LOD model               : Yes
*     RF model                : NA
*     Well proximity effect   : Yes
********************************************************************************
* Revision History:
*
* Version : 0.2_p1
* Date    : 2012/05/17
* Author  : Eason Cheng, Yan Zung Wang
* Remark  : 1.Original release.
*
* Version : 0.3_p1
* Date    : 2012/06/01
* Author  : Eason Cheng
* Remark  : 1. Modify SCREF in model card, and table, plot of WPE chapter in the document.
*           2. Modify SAREF in model card, and table, plot of LOD chapter in the document.
*           3. Update RO tables, plots, dimension ranges and some typo in the document.
*           4. Update Device Performance Reference Tables in the document.
*
* Version : 0.4_p1
* Date    : 2016/09/13
* Author  : Eason Cheng
* Remark  : 1. Set source terminal off current aligned to drain terminal
*              by adding jtssws=jtsswd, jtsswgs=jtsswgd, and xtsswgs=xtsswgd.
*
********************************************************************************
* Application Ranges:
* Geometry range(After shrinkage):
*
* For both Vcc=5 V n-ch and p-ch MOSFET:
*   0.488 um <= LDES <= 10 um
*   0.35 um  <= WDES <= 10 um
*
*   0.36um <=SA, SB
*   0.4um <= SC (for well edge is perpendicular to poly)
*   0.75um <= SC (for well edge is parallel to poly)
*
*
* Note: It is recommended to adopt multi-finger structures if WDES > 10 um.
*       SAREF=SBREF=3.6um and SCREF=2.0um are the reference dimensions of the STI-stress (LOD) effect
*       and Well Proximity Effect (WPE).
*
* Voltage range:
* For n-ch MOSFET:
*        0V <= VGS <= Vcc (*1.1)
*        0V <= VDS <= Vcc (*1.1)
*       -3V <= VBS <= 0V
* For p-ch MOSFET:
*        0V >= VGS >= -Vcc (*1.1)
*        0V >= VDS >= -Vcc (*1.1)
*        3V >= VBS >= 0V
*
* Temperature range: -40c ~ 125c ; nominal temperature=25c.
***************************** Start of Model Card ******************************


